ing and offer the listed remedy; do not silently switch methods or shrink the target.","tools":[{"descriptor":{"method":"PER_CELL","toolName":"hanaworlds_proposal","purpose":"Fine edits of individual cells: a building, a door, a window row or a small correction, through the existing per-cell BUILD path.","inputType":"BuildProposal","typicalScale":"A single cell up to a few hundred cells, usually inside one 16×16×16 mapblock. Typical scale is guidance for the skill, not a limit: Workshop has no size threshold or setting, never truncates a proposal, changes its target or switches method.","scaleUnit":"cells","requiredCapabilities":["BUILD/V3:per-cell-compile"],"unavailableReason":null},"guidance":{"whenToUse":"The change is small and each cell matters, or the user asks for precise detail; also to refine after a region write.","notFor":"Large terrain fills or digging; a per-cell proposal only writes currently known-empty cells, so replacing or digging existing nodes needs REGION.","input":"BuildProposal {decision:\"BUILD\", materials:{alias:{nodeName,param2}}, boxes:[{min:[x,y,z],max:[x,y,z],materialRef}]} in the captured frame; a 1×1×1 box is one cell."},"availability":{"method":"PER_CELL","available":true,"unmet":[]}},{"descriptor":{"method":"REGION","toolName":"hanaworlds_region_proposal","purpose":"Large fill or dig in one Canvas transaction: flatten or raise terrain, fill a basin, carve a valley or clear a slab.","inputType":"RegionProposal","typicalScale":"Hundreds to millions of cells across many 16×16×16 mapblocks, written per mapblock as one logical transaction with whole-region Undo. Typical scale is guidance for the skill, not a limit: Workshop has no size threshold or setting, never truncates a proposal, changes its target or switches method.","scaleUnit":"cells","requiredCapabilities":["canvas-region/v1:compressed-before-snapshot","canvas-region/v1:rollback-on-failure","canvas-region/v1:single-logical-transaction","canvas-region/v1:whole-region-undo","painter-region/v1:validate-region-proposal","region-build/v1:compile-mapblock-chunks"],"unavailableReason":"PEER_UNAVAILABLE: needs Painter service hanaworldsPainterRegionV1 (painter-region/v1); PEER_UNAVAILABLE: needs Brush service hanaworldsBrushRegionV1 (region-build/v1); PEER_UNAVAILABLE: needs Canvas service hanaworldsCanvasRegionV1 (canvas-region/v1)"},"guidance":{"whenToUse":"The change covers a large volume, spans mapblocks, or must replace/dig existing terrain.","notFor":"A few detail cells; use PER_CELL to refine afterwards.","input":"RegionProposal {decision:\"REGION\", block: region-voxels/v1 {origin (world node min corner), size, indexOrder X_FASTEST_THEN_Y_THEN_Z, palette of catalogue NodeSpecs, runs [count, paletteIndex|null]}}. Explicit {nodeName:\"air\",param2:0} digs; null means unspecified and is never air."},"availability":{"method":"REGION","available":false,"unmet":[{"code":"PEER_UNAVAILABLE","need":"Painter service hanaworldsPainterRegionV1 (painter-region/v1)","remedy":"Install/enable a Painter plugin providing painter-region/v1 in this Host."},{"code":"PEER_UNAVAILABLE","need":"Brush service hanaworldsBrushRegionV1 (region-build/v1)","remedy":"Install/enable a Brush plugin providing region-build/v1 in this Host."},{"code":"PEER_UNAVAILABLE","need":"Canvas service hanaworldsCanvasRegionV1 (canvas-region/v1)","remedy":"Install/enable a Canvas plugin providing canvas-region/v1 in this Host."}]}}],"currentBuild":null},"media":{"attachmentRef":"sha256:ff9f970de8b6a6c692eb9703a7ae2d37db2a0e3bd59fdd260d496cc7924aa6b3","storedBytesDigest":"ff9f970de8b6a6c692eb9703a7ae2d37db2a0e3bd59fdd260d496cc7924aa6b3","projectionVariantId":null,"projectionBytesDigest":null,"mediaType":"image/png","bytes":96,"width":2,"height":2},"proposal":{"contractVersion":"painter/v4","requestId":"proposal","result":{"invocationId":"proposal-b399280f-31f4-424d-b622-773fb0afaa98","build":{"contractVersion":"BUILD/V3","documentId":"exterior-proposal-b399280f-31f4-424d-b622-773fb0afa